    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You grew up on the streets among other unlucky outcasts, some of them friends and some of them rivals. You slept wherever you could and worked odd jobs for food, and when hunger became too much to bear, you sometimes stole. Yet you never lost your pride or gave up hope: fate isn't done with you yet.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.0FdfMi10b60fl9Wt]{Lucky}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Insight and Stealth</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulThievesToo]{Thieves' Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Daggers}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulThievesToo]{Thieves' Tools}, Gaming Set (any), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouches}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 16 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
